eak-proof lid and  stainless steel filter for loose leaf  tea  or fruit infusion number three a  nintendo switch carrying case  for anyone who travels with their switch  often a carrying case is a must  and if you're an animal crossing fan  you'll be excited to know nintendo has  just the case for you  the case is a simple teal and white with  the leaf pattern that has appeared  throughout the animal crossing series  you should know they make two versions  of these one for the standard nintendo  switch and one for the nintendo switch  light number four an animal crossing  plush  this is the glorious plush toy or as i  like to call it tom nook pillow  from club mochi mochi i've already done  a full review here on the channel  but you should know you can also get a  version with isabelle an apple  or a leaf there are two different sizes  the mega and the junior so make sure you  click  the correct one and i have to say it is  a very soft and very cuddly plush  number five nintendo switch animal  crossing themed  skins nintendo released a special  edition of the nintendo switch which  featured animal crossing on the dock  and on the joy-cons more on that later  unfortunately this was a limited run and  these are pretty hard to find now at  least  at a decent price the next best thing  making your own animal crossing themed  switch  using skins there are many different  designs for these online but here's one  of my favorites that looks similar to  the official animal crossing themed  switch from nintendo  all right we're halfway through if  you've already seen something you'd love  to have go ahead and give me a thumbs up  on this video as we move on to number  six  a makeup bag look another one here that  made my wife really excited when she  took a look i mean for real how adorable  is this  i picked one here that strays away from  that traditional leaf pattern and gives  us a bit more personality  you'll also find several fan favorite  characters featured including 